{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-harness-seam-015-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/TestCommandC1DispatchTests.cs", "line": 326, "method": "KscAction_ResearchNode_ScienceMode_Executes_ButOthersStayCareerOnly", "category": "T2", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/TestCommands/TestCommandDispatcher.cs:527; narrow research-node readiness to state.CareerPresent -> red, alongside the matrix rows that already cover it", "what_it_asserts": "research-node executes in SCIENCE_SANDBOX (CareerPresent=false, RnDPresent=true) while hire-kerbal defers career-not-ready.", "why_weak": "Both cells are already rows 5 and 6 of KscAction_ModeSubActionMatrix (line 314), driven through the same Mode() helper with the same observable; nothing extra is pinned.", "proposed_action": "Delete the cell and move its OQ1 rationale comment onto the matrix's SCIENCE_SANDBOX row block, so the reason survives without a second copy of the assertions.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
