{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "InGameTestSidecarReaper", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/InGameTests/InGameTestSidecarReaper.cs", "sut_line": 174, "case_kind": "integration", "proposed_name": "SidecarSuffixes_CoverEveryPerRecordingRecordingPathsBuilder", "sketch": "Reflect RecordingPaths for public/internal static string Build*RelativePath(string) methods; for each, write a stub file named by GetFileName(builder(id)) in tempDir; call DeleteSidecarsForIdsIn and assert deleted == builder count and no file survives.", "guards": "A new per-recording sidecar suffix added to RecordingPaths without a matching entry in the reaper's SidecarSuffixes, which leaves orphan sidecars after every in-game recording-pipeline test.", "risk": "recording"}
